      "statement": "The REST API endpoints are organized into categories: resource CRUD (workers, teams, humans, managers, projects), lifecycle (wake/sleep/ensure-ready/ready/status), message injection, gateway management (consumers and providers), credentials (STS and Matrix token), appservice management, manager tasks, packages, and status/health.",
